Test fixtures and the calibration corpus
----------------------------------------
`test/fixtures/arc-dot.svg` and `test/fixtures/use-inheritance.svg` are minimal
reproductions taken from public svgo issue reports (#2104 and #2239). They are
tiny SVG documents, copied for regression coverage; the issue text itself is not
reproduced.

`test/corpus/*.svg` files are third-party icon and logo assets collected from
public npm packages that were already present on the development machine
(iconmonstr icons, Keyv, css-tree, and project logos). They are included only as
input data for the false-positive measurement in `README.md`. They are not
covered by svggate's MIT licence; consult each file's originating package for its
own terms, and delete the directory if you redistribute this repository
commercially.
